{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"liyue_mora_golden_house","name_zh":"摩拉与黄金屋","name_en":"Mora and Golden House","aliases":["摩拉与黄金屋","Mora and Golden House"],"category":"institution","scope":"cross_regional","regions":["Liyue"],"summary":"摩拉是全提瓦特通行的货币，由璃月的黄金屋铸造，并以其创造者摩拉克斯命名。制造摩拉必须借助岩之神的力量；钟离失去神之心后说明，现存摩拉不会消失，但黄金屋将长期停产。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"liyue_mora_golden_house_fact_01","text":"摩拉是全提瓦特通行的货币。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期通行状态","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_mora_golden_house","bwiki_liyue_mora_golden_house","local_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_03"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_mora_golden_house_fact_02","text":"黄金屋位于璃月，是全大陆唯一的铸币厂；全提瓦特流通的摩拉由此铸造。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"黄金屋正常铸币时期","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_04","local_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_01","local_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_03"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_mora_golden_house_fact_03","text":"摩拉以其创造者摩拉克斯之名命名。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"自摩拉得名以来","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_mora_golden_house","local_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_03"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_mora_golden_house_fact_04","text":"摩拉被描述为促成物质转化的一种媒介或“触媒”。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"一般性质","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_mora_golden_house"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_mora_golden_house_fact_05","text":"摩拉克斯能够创造摩拉，而黄金屋制造摩拉时必须借助岩之神的力量。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"岩之神仍能提供相应力量时","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["local_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_01"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_mora_golden_house_fact_06","text":"钟离失去神之心后说明，已经存在的摩拉不会消失，但黄金屋会停产很长一段时间。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"送仙典仪后钟离作出说明的时点及其所述后续时期","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["local_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_01"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_mora_golden_house_fact_07","text":"璃月港危机期间，黄金屋内部被目击存放着大量摩拉。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"璃月港危机期间","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_04"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"璃月港危机期间","order_hint":10,"events":["Childe称璃月七星已经停止铸币；进入黄金屋者同时目击其内部仍存放大量摩拉。"],"current_status":"黄金屋在该事件时点已经停止铸币，但内部仍有大量既存摩拉。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_04"]},{"period":"送仙典仪后的谈话时点","order_hint":20,"events":["钟离说明制造摩拉必须借助岩之神的力量；失去神之心不会使既存摩拉消失，但黄金屋将长期停产。"],"current_status":"该时点能够确认既存摩拉继续存在，黄金屋则进入长期停产状态；证据未说明恢复时间。","source_ids":["local_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_01"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"摩拉是通行全提瓦特、由璃月黄金屋铸造并以摩拉克斯命名的货币。璃月人可将这一点作为本国商贸成就向外国人介绍。","likely_known_by":["璃月民众与商贸从业者","璃月政务人员","熟悉提瓦特货币体系的商人","曾进入黄金屋或参与相关事件者"],"unlikely_known_by":["不了解璃月货币来源的普通外国人","未获钟离说明的普通民众"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["失去岩神会使现存摩拉一并消失的担忧并不成立；钟离明确说明既存摩拉不会消失。"]},"activation_keys":["摩拉与黄金屋","Mora and Golden House"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["摩拉的任务、宝箱、怪物、地脉、树脂、商店、战令、活动等玩家获取途径","摩拉用于角色、武器、圣遗物升级等玩家养成系统的内容","黄金屋相关任务步骤、秘境、战斗阶段、生命值、成就、奖励与音轨"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["黄金屋停产后的恢复时间、后续产能及替代铸币方案","摩拉作为物质转化媒介的具体作用机制","对黄金屋是否存在防盗陷阱的玩家对话推测"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_liyue_mora_golden_house","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Mora","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mora","language":"en","revision_id":"2106722","source_text_sha256":"4c85fe0e5fae4eadc11f9c5e1be6f787ff63af7d0f12f84655902152e7bc26ab"},{"source_id":"bwiki_liyue_mora_golden_house","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"摩拉","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E6%91%A9%E6%8B%89","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"584984","source_text_sha256":"f4af5e7ccee6b791de9217c6549f97742a77e94e921122690bcc46523275dd34"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_mora_golden_house_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Heart of Glaze","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Heart_of_Glaze","language":"en","revision_id":"2112801","source_text_sha256":"051f69178556f39bfff732e43ef8b705ecdada3da4c9cd1fa930f501b14